<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/april-29">29 April</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Rioting erupts in Los Angeles after the Rodney King verdict</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Riots began after four police officers were acquitted of beating Rodney King. Over six days more than 60 people died and damage reached about $1 billion.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/maastricht-treaty" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/maastricht-treaty.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Treaty</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/maastricht-treaty">Maastricht Treaty</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Maastricht Treaty, formally the Treaty on European Union, was signed in the Dutch city of Maastricht in February 1992 and came into force in November 1993.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/1992-summer-olympics" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/1992-summer-olympics.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Event</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/1992-summer-olympics">1992 Summer Olympics</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The 1992 Summer Olympics were held in Barcelona, Spain, from 25 July to 9 August 1992.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/chapultepec-peace-accords" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/chapultepec-peace-accords.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Treaty · Peace</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/chapultepec-peace-accords">Chapultepec Peace Accords</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Chapultepec Peace Accords were signed in Chapultepec Castle in Mexico City on 16 January 1992 by the government of El Salvador and the FMLN, after negotiations under United Nations mediation.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Event</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/mabo-v-queensland-no-2">Mabo v Queensland (No 2)</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Mabo v Queensland (No 2) was a 1992 decision of the High Court of Australia in a case brought by Eddie Mabo and other Meriam people of the Torres Strait.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Event</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/expo-92">Expo '92</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Expo '92 was a world's fair held in Seville, Spain, from 20 April to 12 October 1992, marking the 500th anniversary of Columbus's first voyage to the Americas.</p></div></li></ol></section>
